<br />
<em>Please collapse long posts. ~Zyn</em>
<p>I initially chose Pangloss for this tale because it's easy for me to imagine him as a/the big good of the Foundationverse. We know he's there, but we never really see him. His name keeps popping up around all these little miracles. All his notes seem pretty soft-spoken. All he really seems to want is to guide and inspire humanity.<br />
Now, I tend to view SD as a foil to this. He might not be completely evil, but he seems very chaotic-evil/neutral in contrast to Pangloss' chaotic/neutral-good. We see references to him pop up here and there throughout the database. When we do see him, he's loudmouthed and arrogant. Rather than helping people, his intent seems to be to troll the universe for all it's worth.</p>

							</div>

								
