														</div>
			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-2362970">
									

<p>He's in two tales besides this. He dies in both of them. Fae broke the trend. Furthermore, the reason he exists is to make fun of artsy types. That's the entire reason Flameshirt (Flameshirt is the character's creator, yes?) created the character: as a parody of obnoxiously artsy/poetic types. The best way to deal with the character, in my head, is to destroy him in order to highlight the pointlessness of his poetic attitude towards everything.</p>
<p>Making him God does not jive with me.</p>

